{"id":"n62511-1-13","stage":1,"title":"스포츠 · 体育","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62511-1-13-1","ko":"주말에 같이 축구 경기를 보러 갈래?","zh":"周末一起去看足球比赛怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"주말에","meaning":"周末","explanation":"주말：周末；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"주말","audio":"/audio/dc80d0fe247835379f4f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"19548","senseId":"1","lemma":"주말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같이","meaning":"一同，一块儿，共同","explanation":"같이：一同，一块儿，共同","readings":[{"term":"같이","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26799","senseId":"2","lemma":"같이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"축구","meaning":"足球","explanation":"축구：足球","readings":[{"term":"축구","audio":"/audio/c21dee4a35ad739ca03e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36700","senseId":"1","lemma":"축구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"경기를","meaning":"竞技，比赛，竞赛","explanation":"경기：竞技，比赛，竞赛；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"경기","audio":"/audio/e56314e9a18b80c16a81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60094","senseId":"1","lemma":"경기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보러","meaning":"看，观看，观赏","explanation":"보다：看，观看，观赏；러：用于移动动词前，表示移动的目的：“去/来做……”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갈래?","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；ㄹ래：非敬语地表达意愿或询问对方意愿。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"dc80d0fe24783537","term":"주말","zh":"周末","audio":"/audio/dc80d0fe247835379f4f.mp3","entryId":"19548","definition":"一周的尽头。","pronunciation":["주말"]},{"id":"d44da011993f2a6e","term":"같이","zh":"一同，一块儿，共同","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3","entryId":"26799","definition":"和某物或某人一起。","pronunciation":["가치"]},{"id":"c21dee4a35ad739c","term":"축구","zh":"足球","audio":"/audio/c21dee4a35ad739ca03e.mp3","entryId":"36700","definition":"由11人组成一队，主要用脚或头把球打入对方球门的比赛，进球多的一方获胜。","pronunciation":["축꾸"]},{"id":"e56314e9a18b80c1","term":"경기","zh":"竞技，比赛，竞赛","audio":"/audio/e56314e9a18b80c16a81.mp3","entryId":"60094","definition":"互相比较运动或技术等的能力。","pronunciation":["경ː기"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看，观看，观赏","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛享受或欣赏某个对象。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9d69fb576886ecb5a716.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62511-1-13-2","ko":"싫어. 스포츠는 몸으로 직접 해야지 보는 건 재미없어.","zh":"不想去。运动得亲自参与才行，光看可没意思。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"싫어.","meaning":"不愿意，不想","explanation":"싫다：不愿意，不想；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"싫다","audio":"/audio/2011ef2922f6c340fc2d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57271","senseId":"2","lemma":"싫다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"스포츠는","meaning":"体育，运动，竞赛","explanation":"스포츠：体育，运动，竞赛；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"스포츠","audio":"/audio/8632f0d97a762ee8cdab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62511","senseId":"1","lemma":"스포츠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"몸으로","meaning":"身体，身子","explanation":"몸：身体，身子；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"몸","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74138","senseId":"1","lemma":"몸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"직접","meaning":"亲手，亲自","explanation":"직접：亲手，亲自","readings":[{"term":"직접","audio":"/audio/20c483bdda9706e41f07.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71493","senseId":"1","lemma":"직접","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해야지","meaning":"表示前面动作非常有必要或希望成为该状态。","explanation":"하다：表示前面动作非常有必要或希望成为该状态。；어야지：表示必要条件或应当如此，再接后面的判断。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"3","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보는","meaning":"看，观看，观赏","explanation":"보다：看，观看，观赏；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"건","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"재미없어.","meaning":"无趣，没意思，没劲儿","explanation":"재미없다：无趣，没意思，没劲儿；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"재미없다","audio":"/audio/b086b052fd147207e465.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57315","senseId":"1","lemma":"재미없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2011ef2922f6c340","term":"싫다","zh":"不愿意，不想","audio":"/audio/2011ef2922f6c340fc2d.mp3","entryId":"57271","definition":"不情愿做某事。","pronunciation":["실타"]},{"id":"8632f0d97a762ee8","term":"스포츠","zh":"体育，运动，竞赛","audio":"/audio/8632f0d97a762ee8cdab.mp3","entryId":"62511","definition":"为了锻炼身体或健康，规律地活动身体或使用器具比赛。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"955149b012635be1","term":"몸","zh":"身体，身子","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3","entryId":"74138","definition":"指从头到脚组成人或动物形象的整体；或指其状态。","pronunciation":["몸"]},{"id":"20c483bdda9706e4","term":"직접","zh":"亲手，亲自","audio":"/audio/20c483bdda9706e41f07.mp3","entryId":"71493","definition":"没有人或物介入在中间而直接。","pronunciation":["직쩝"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示前面动作非常有必要或希望成为该状态。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"表示前面动作非常有必要或希望成为该状态。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看，观看，观赏","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛享受或欣赏某个对象。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"b086b052fd147207","term":"재미없다","zh":"无趣，没意思，没劲儿","audio":"/audio/b086b052fd147207e465.mp3","entryId":"57315","definition":"没有欢欣愉悦的感觉。","pronunciation":["재미업따"]}],"audio":"/audio/3dd77344b1f0556137b9.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.5,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62511","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":52,"sequenceScore":2.3267,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["周末一起去看足球比赛怎么样？","不想去。运动得亲自参与才行，光看可没意思。","鞋怎么这么脏？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["周末一起去看足球比赛怎么样？","不想去。运动得亲自参与才行，光看可没意思。","鞋怎么这么脏？"],"answer":1}]}
